          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Makes Us Different",
            "content": "",
            "liquid": "<p>ECO-Friendly Wheat Straw Biodegradable Stimulating Scalp Brush<\/p>\n<p>Healthy hair begins with a healthy scalp. Regularly massaging your scalp promotes blood circulation and flow to the scalp, boosting scalp health.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove debris from product buildup and dead skin<\/li>\n<li>Cell buildup<\/li>\n<li>Relaxing experience<\/li>\n<li>Perfect in conjunction with our <a href=\"https:\/\/unveilhaircare.com\/products\/no-3-unveil-thicker-hair-serum-30ml-1oz\">Serum<\/a>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Safe for all hair types | Can be used on wet or dry hair | Easy to clean<\/p>",
            "default_open": false
          }
        },
        "f3572860-3133-443b-8acf-81054f33e5e5": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "content": "<p>Holding the massager and gently press the tips to your scalp and massage in circular motions. Use all over the scalp. <\/p><p><\/p><p>Can be used on wet or dry hair, with or without product. The goal is to increase circulation, remove debris and create a feeling of wellbeing and self care. <\/p><p><\/p><p>You can use it in or out of the shower. Our creator likes to use it dry however, some clients use it when shampooing their hair.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Rinse the massager in cool water and hang to dry weekly with daily use. <\/p>",
            "liquid": "",
            "default_open": false
          }
        }
